?><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Buyer Intent Analytics | TechSelectAI</title><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><style>body{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#f7f9fc;color:#172033}.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 20px}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:end}.filters a{margin-left:8px}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:20px 0}.metric,.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:15px;padding:16px}.metric strong{font-size:28px;color:#123b67}.metric span{display:block;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;margin-top:5px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.panel h2{margin-top:0}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7}.row:last-child{border-bottom:0}.muted{color:#64748b;font-size:12px}.empty{color:#64748b}.note{margin-top:20px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef6fa;color:#40566d}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.head{display:block}.filters{margin-top:12px}.filters a{margin:0 8px 0 0}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><div class="head"><div><h1>Buyer Intent Analytics</h1><p class="muted">Aggregated software-search demand. Raw private consultation text is not exposed in this dashboard.</p></div><div class="filters"><a href="?days=7">7 days</a><a href="?days=30">30 days</a><a href="?days=90">90 days</a></div></div><div id="app">Loading…</div></main><script>
